---
description: Email-safe HTML output constraints for the signature compiler.
globs: ["packages/compiler/**/*.ts"]
alwaysApply: false
---

# Signature HTML output rules
- Table-based layout with fully inline styles ONLY.
- NEVER emit: flexbox, CSS grid, `<script>`, `<form>`, `<video>`, external stylesheets, or
  non-HTTPS resource URLs.
- Always escape directory values before interpolation.
- Enforce image dimensions and add `alt` text to every image.
- Produce a plain-text fallback and, where needed, Gmail- and Outlook-specific variants.
- Report the computed HTML size in bytes.
